  "rationale": "Neutral carry of the third-generation candidate D2 (flex_heptane.wsp2, sha256:43f7871f778040550291789ca97e319729675a9dd0df9c9529525c1805ad588d), not a candidate and not to be revised: its numbers are those of D2, typed by the author, unchanged; the entries added by flex_heptane-wsp-v3 (art.min_gated, art.d0_tol, art.rise_tol, art.r_band, art.weight, art.sigma_m, art.sigma_rate_m_s, post.he_w, post.seen_max) are neutral and stay so (no artefact component, no helium term, the third-generation clamp). On the fourth-generation forward it gives the train scores of D2 exactly, and stands in for D2 in paired comparisons with the fourth-generation candidates (same prefix policy). Exposure: that of D2.",
